              "id": "p1000004",
              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "text-editor",
              "settings": {
                "editor": "<p>Ramenhead is a premium ramen restaurant at Speaker's Corner, 37 Parliament Street in Cape Town. We specialise in authentic freshly made noodles produced in-house on the only Yamato noodle machine in Africa, 48-hour simmered Tonkotsu broths, and high-quality Japanese ingredients. Our menu includes classic ramen, vegan options, Japanese street food and a curated selection of sake.</p>",
                "_css_classes": "rh-hidden-seo"
              }
